{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "shopflow-e2e-collection-uuid-1",
    "name": "ShopFlow End-to-End API Tests",
    "description": "This collection runs tests for ShopFlow's microservice APIs via the Gateway (port 8080).\n\n### IMPORTANT MANUAL STEP:\nBefore running request #5 (Admin: Create Product) and onwards, you must promote the first registered user (`admin@shopflow.com`) to the ADMIN role in the database. Run this SQL query in your database tool:\n```sql\nUPDATE users SET role = 'ADMIN' WHERE email = 'admin@shopflow.com';\n```",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Register Admin User",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@shopflow.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"name\": \"ShopFlow Admin\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "auth",
            "register"
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Registration successful - Status code is 201\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test(\"User object returned with ID and default role CUSTOMER\", function () {",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.id).to.be.a('string');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.email).to.eql(\"admin@shopflow.com\");",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.role).to.eql(\"CUSTOMER\");",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
